xcheck 1
origin observed 2026-11-28 docs/platform-capabilities.md at commit eab4162; constraints read from hvs-backend-design.md
# Hand-written topology, not produced by the converter. No hardware claim.
# Source: docs/platform-capabilities.md (probe output observed 2026-11-28), repository commit eab4162.
# Constraint lines are read from docs/hvs-backend-design.md; nothing was run for this file.
# No frames in this file.
# Planes are the 16 of probe's cut view (MAX_PLANES = 16), not the kernel's 60.
# Output: the one connected CRTC (DSI, portrait 720x1280). Masks as recorded: 0x1 reaches it, 0x0 other CRTCs.
profile generic
output 90 720 1280 60000
# Cursor planes: the recorded probe view lists none (hvs-backend-design.md section 3: the extra
# per-CRTC planes were not typed). If one is added later keep it here; cross-check v1 does not
# exercise cursor planes (design section 4).
# transforms: rotate-0/180 and reflect-x/y, no 90/270 (hvs-backend-design.md section 3, tag source;
# observed 2026-11-28 on BCM2712). Not read from this dump if it records no rotation mask.
# scaling=none on every plane: KMS has no scaling property and the design states no values
# (sections 3 and 5, open question 1 in section 7); not invented here.
# max_source=8191x7680: width 8191 and height from the 7680 mode limit (hvs-backend-design.md sections 3, 4 and 5; HVS5, tag source).
# full_output=0: neither the design nor the dump states a full-output requirement.
# No group lines: the design names LBM/UPM limits (sections 3 and 4) but gives no capacity to adopt;
# check (TEST_ONLY) stays authoritative there.
# zpos_now: the dump records no current overlay zpos (debugfs shows normalized-zpos only for plane 79),
# so zpos_now is the plane's 0-based index in this file's plane order (6..15).
# formats: the 32 pairs as probe printed them, in dump order. The dump reports no modifiers, so 0x0 (linear) is a placeholder, not an observation.
plane 48 kind=primary outputs=0x0 zpos=fixed:0 alpha=1 blend=opaque,premul,coverage transforms=normal,rot180,flip_h,flip_v scaling=none max_source=8191x7680 full_output=0
